{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Let them seek.</b> With the force of the ayin, and it ought to have a dagesh, and there are many like it. And the word \"seekers\" is elided, like אשר ילדה אותה ללוי (which she bore to Levi)."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:45.134888303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}